      "evidence": {
        "before": {
          "html": "<article class=\"question-card\"><div class=\"question-type\">CONNECTION 01 · LIGHT CAPTURE</div><h2>A plant has light, water and carbon dioxide, but makes much less chlorophyll. Which direct change is most likely in the light reactions?</h2><p class=\"prompt\">Choose the best explanation, then connect it to the larger idea.</p><div class=\"choices\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Answer options\"><button class=\"choice incorrect\" data-choice=\"1\" disabled=\"\"><span class=\"choice-key\">A</span>Less carbon dioxide is absorbed directly by chlorophyll</button><button class=\"choice\" data-choice=\"3\" disabled=\"\"><span class=\"choice-key\">B</span>More oxygen is split to replace chlorophyll's supply of electrons</button><button class=\"choice correct\" data-choice=\"0\" disabled=\"\"><span class=\"choice-key\">C</span>Less light energy is absorbed to drive electron transfer</button><button class=\"choice\" data-choice=\"2\" disabled=\"\"><span class=\"choice-key\">D</span>More glucose is split to replace light absorption in photosystems</button></div><div id=\"feedback-slot\"><div class=\"feedback\"><strong>Here’s the correction.</strong><p><strong>Your answer:</strong> Less carbon dioxide is absorbed directly by chlorophyll</p><p><strong>Correct answer:</strong> Less light energy is absorbed to drive electron transfer</p>Chlorophyll absorbs light energy that drives electron transfer in photosynthesis. Making much less chlorophyll reduces this light capture; chlorophyll does not absorb carbon dioxide or split oxygen.<span class=\"why\">Try this transfer: This links a visible input (light) to the first energy-conversion step.</span></div><button class=\"primary-button next-button\" id=\"next-button\">Follow the next thread <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></button></div><div class=\"mastery-box\"><h3>Estimated mastery · model state, not a grade</h3><div class=\"mastery-row\"><span>Light capture</span><div class=\"mastery-meter\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span style=\"width:21%\"></span></div><output aria-label=\"Light capture estimated mastery 21 percent\">21%</output></div><div class=\"mastery-row\"><span>Stored sugar</span><div class=\"mastery-meter\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span style=\"width:22%\"></span></div><output aria-label=\"Stored sugar estimated mastery 22 percent\">22%</output></div><div class=\"mastery-row\"><span>Respiration</span><div class=\"mastery-meter\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span style=\"width:22%\"></span></div><output aria-label=\"Respiration estimated mastery 22 percent\">22%</output></div><div class=\"mastery-row\"><span>ATP transfer</span><div class=\"mastery-meter\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span style=\"width:22%\"></span></div><output aria-label=\"ATP transfer estimated mastery 22 percent\">22%</output></div></div></article>",
          "progress": "1 / 6",
